    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "重大事件",
    title: "印度核電廠承包商資料外洩：疑似波及庫丹庫拉姆核電廠工程資料",
    summary: "印度核電廠承包商 Reliance Group 的工程資料疑似發生外洩事件。獨立資安研究人員透過關鍵字搜尋，在公開的資料中找到大量疑似與庫丹庫拉姆核電廠（KKNPP）相關的檔案，總量約達 14.3 GB，包含近 1.9 萬個文件。這些資料涉及核電廠仍在興建的 3 號及 4 號機組的工程資訊。雖然目前尚未確認資料的確切洩漏管道或攻擊手法，但資料外洩的性質極可能涉及敏感的關鍵基礎設施（Critical Infrastructure）資訊。建議相關機構應立即強化資料存取控制、實施資料分類與權限管理，並監控公開的網路空間，以應對潛在的情報竊取或惡意利用風險。",
    tags: ["Reliance Group", "庫丹庫拉姆核電廠", "KKNPP", "資料外洩", "關鍵基礎設施", "勒索軟體"],
    title_en: "Leak of Indian Nuclear Power Plant Contractor Data: Potential Impact on Kudankulam Nuclear Power Plant Engineering Data",
    summary_en: "Engineering data belonging to Indian nuclear power plant contractor Reliance Group is suspected of having been leaked. Independent cybersecurity researchers found a large volume of files in public data, many of which appear related to the Kudankulam Nuclear Power Plant (KKNPP), totaling approximately 14.3 GB and containing nearly 19,000 documents. This data involves engineering information for Units 3 and 4, which are currently under construction at the nuclear power plant. Although the exact leakage vector or attack method has not yet been confirmed, the nature of the data leak highly suggests the involvement of sensitive Critical Infrastructure information. It is recommended that relevant organizations immediately strengthen data access controls, implement data classification and permission management, and monitor public cyberspace to address potential risks of intelligence theft or malicious exploitation.",
