    category: "Apple",
    title: "集體訴訟指控 Apple 隱私功能「Hide My Email」存在缺陷，可能洩露真實電子郵件地址",
    summary: "一名加州用戶提起的集體訴訟，指控 Apple 誤導客戶關於「Hide My Email」隱私保護功能。該功能允許用戶建立隨機生成的電子郵件別名，用於接收訊息，從而無需分享真實地址。根據報告，安全研究人員早在 2025 年 6 月就向 Apple 警示了此功能可能洩露真實電子郵件地址的缺陷。儘管 Apple 曾承認並在 2026 年 3 月聲稱已修復，但研究人員指出此漏洞仍可被利用。原告主張 Apple 已知此問題超過一年，卻持續從該功能獲利，並要求法院強制 Apple 修復此缺陷或明確揭露其限制。訴訟涵蓋使用該功能的廣大客戶群，並涉及 Apple 過去其他隱私功能（如隨機 MAC 位址）可能存在暴露真實識別碼的爭議。Apple 尚未對此訴訟發表評論。",
    tags: ["Apple", "Hide My Email", "集體訴訟", "隱私保護", "電子郵件別名", "CVE"],
    title_en: "Class-Action Lawsuit Accuses Apple's 'Hide My Email' Privacy Feature of Flaw That May Leak Real Email Addresses",
    summary_en: "A class-action lawsuit filed by a California user accuses Apple of misleading customers regarding the 'Hide My Email' privacy feature. This feature allows users to create randomly generated email aliases to receive messages without sharing their real address. According to reports, security researchers had warned Apple as early as June 2025 that this feature might have a flaw that could leak the real email address. Although Apple acknowledged the issue and claimed to have fixed it in March 2026, researchers point out that this vulnerability remains exploitable. The plaintiffs argue that Apple knew about this problem for over a year but continued to profit from the feature, demanding that the court force Apple to fix the defect or clearly disclose its limitations. The lawsuit covers a large customer base that uses the feature and involves disputes over Apple's past privacy features (such as random MAC addresses) that may have exposed real identifiers. Apple has not commented on the lawsuit.",
    tags_en: ["Apple", "Hide My Email", "Class-Action Lawsuit", "Privacy Protection", "Email Alias", "CVE"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Mac", url: "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/16/class-action-accuses-apple-of-misleading-users-about-hide-my-emails-privacy-protections", lang: "EN" }
    ]
