    category: "Apple",
    title: "iOS 27 升級 Apple Music AutoMix 功能，提供更流暢、沉浸式的歌曲過渡體驗",
    summary: "本文介紹 iOS 27 系統中升級的 Apple Music AutoMix 功能。AutoMix 是一款利用人工智慧技術，在歌曲間創造 DJ 式過渡效果的功能。相較於 iOS 26 版本，iOS 27 的 AutoMix 顯著提升了過渡的流暢度和沉浸感。新版本不僅取代了過往預設的「水下」音效，更具備重新混音歌曲的尾聲和開場，以完美對齊節奏，並重複部分內容來銜接過渡。此功能已在 iOS 27 的公開 Beta 版本中可用，並將於今年晚些時候全面發布。此升級旨在讓音樂聆聽體驗更具活力與趣味性，特別適合用於派對或社交場合。",
    tags: ["iOS 27", "Apple Music", "AutoMix", "Apple", "macOS", "tvOS"],
    title_en: "iOS 27 upgrades Apple Music AutoMix feature, offering a smoother, more immersive song transition experience",
    summary_en: "This article introduces the upgraded Apple Music AutoMix feature in the iOS 27 operating system. AutoMix is a function that uses artificial intelligence technology to create DJ-style transitions between songs. Compared to the iOS 26 version, the AutoMix in iOS 27 significantly enhances the smoothness and immersion of the transitions. The new version not only replaces the previous default 'underwater' sound effect but also features re-mixing the song's outro and intro to perfectly align the rhythm, and repeats certain content to bridge the transition. This feature is currently available in the public Beta version of iOS 27 and will be fully released later this year. This upgrade aims to make the music listening experience more vibrant and engaging, making it particularly suitable for parties or social gatherings.",
