    title: "WhatsApp 整合 iPhone 麥克風模式切換功能，提升通話音訊處理能力",
    summary: "WhatsApp 近期更新了通話介面，讓用戶可以直接在通話畫面切換使用 iPhone 系統提供的麥克風模式。過去用戶需透過控制中心才能選擇，現在已整合至通話介面底部「更多」按鈕中。此功能讓用戶能即時選擇四種麥克風模式：自動（Automatic）、標準（Standard）、語音隔離（Voice Isolation）和廣譜（Wide Spectrum）。這些模式能決定麥克風如何處理通話中的音訊。例如，「語音隔離」能優先捕捉人聲並阻擋環境雜音，而「自動」模式則會根據通話情境自動選擇最佳模式。此功能能提升通話的音訊品質，但其可用性仍依賴 iOS 版本，其中「自動」模式需要 iOS 18 或更高版本，且功能會分批推送給用戶，尚未全面開放。",
    tags: ["WhatsApp", "iPhone", "iOS", "麥克風模式", "通訊軟體", "語音隔離"],
    title_en: "WhatsApp integrates iPhone microphone mode switching feature to enhance call audio processing capabilities",
    summary_en: "WhatsApp recently updated its calling interface, allowing users to directly switch microphone modes provided by the iPhone system within the call screen. Previously, users had to go through the Control Center to select the mode; now, it is integrated into the 'More' button at the bottom of the call interface. This feature allows users to instantly select four microphone modes: Automatic, Standard, Voice Isolation, and Wide Spectrum. These modes determine how the microphone processes audio during a call. For example, 'Voice Isolation' prioritizes capturing human voices while blocking environmental noise, while 'Automatic' mode automatically selects the optimal mode based on the call context. This feature enhances call audio quality, but its availability still depends on the iOS version. Specifically, the 'Automatic' mode requires iOS 18 or higher, and the feature is being rolled out to users in phases and is not yet fully available.",
