    title: "Apple 公布 AirPods 公開 Beta 韌體 9.0.314，新增自訂 EQ 功能",
    summary: "Apple 發布了支援 AirPods 的公開 Beta 韌體版本 9.0.314，為多款支援型號帶來了長期期待的自訂 EQ（Equalizer）功能。使用者可在 iPhone 的「設定」App 中，透過「音訊與路由」選單調整 AirPods 的低音、中音和高音頻率，以客製化音訊聆聽體驗。此功能適用於所有搭載 H2 晶片的 AirPods 型號，包括 AirPods Pro 2、AirPods Pro 3、AirPods 4 和 AirPods Max 2。此外，iOS 27 的更新也優化了 AirPods 的設定介面，並新增了 Adaptive Audio 滑桿、將 GymKit 體驗擴展至 iPhone，以及透過 Apple Watch 進行精準尋找等功能。使用者可透過 iPhone 的「設定」App 啟用 Beta 韌體更新，建議使用者留意官方公告以掌握最新功能。",
    tags: ["Apple", "AirPods", "iOS 27", "韌體更新", "自訂 EQ", "Apple Watch"],
    title_en: "Apple Releases AirPods Public Beta Firmware 9.0.314, Adding Custom EQ Feature",
    summary_en: "Apple has released public beta firmware version 9.0.314 supporting AirPods, bringing the long-awaited custom EQ (Equalizer) feature to multiple supported models. Users can adjust the bass, mid-range, and treble frequencies of their AirPods within the 'Audio & Routing' menu in the iPhone's 'Settings' app, allowing for a customized audio listening experience. This feature is applicable to all AirPods models equipped with the H2 chip, including AirPods Pro 2, AirPods Pro 3, AirPods 4, and AirPods Max 2. Furthermore, the iOS 27 update optimizes the AirPods settings interface and adds features such as an Adaptive Audio slider, extending the GymKit experience to the iPhone, and precise finding via Apple Watch. Users can enable the beta firmware update through the iPhone's 'Settings' app and are advised to monitor official announcements for the latest features.",
