    title: "Motorola Edge 70 Max 軟體更新政策混亂：用戶需注意不同地區的支援年限差異",
    summary: "本文分析了 Motorola 近期發布的 Edge 70 Max 設備，指出該品牌在軟體更新政策上存在極大的不一致性和混亂性。雖然英國網站宣稱 Edge 70 Max 可獲得至 2031 年的安全性更新和「高達 3 年」的作業系統升級，但其附註的描述（「從全球發布日開始的 3 年安全更新」）與主文的年份產生矛盾。更甚者，不同地區的資訊也存在差異，例如在瑞典，僅承諾 3 年的更新期，而歐盟的 EPREL 標籤則宣稱 7 年。文章指出，Motorola 的更新政策缺乏統一的標準，用戶在購買時難以掌握確切的支援年限。此外，該品牌在實際推送更新的效率上也曾受到質疑，提醒消費者在購買 Motorola 設備時，應了解其更新支持的實際狀況，並注意不同地區的政策差異。",
    tags: ["Motorola", "Edge 70 Max", "Android 軟體更新", "軟體支援", "設備生命週期"],
    title_en: "Motorola Edge 70 Max Software Update Policy Confusion: Users Must Note Differences in Regional Support Lifespans",
    summary_en: "This article analyzes the recently released Motorola Edge 70 Max device, pointing out significant inconsistency and confusion in the brand's software update policies. Although the UK website claims the Edge 70 Max is eligible for security updates until 2031 and up to '3 years' of OS upgrades, the accompanying description ('3 years of security updates from the global release date') contradicts the year mentioned in the main text. Furthermore, there are discrepancies in information across different regions; for instance, Sweden only promises a 3-year update period, while the EU's EPREL label claims 7 years. The article points out that Motorola's update policy lacks a unified standard, making it difficult for users to grasp the exact support lifespan upon purchase. Additionally, the brand has faced scrutiny regarding the efficiency of actual update rollouts, reminding consumers that when purchasing a Motorola device, they should understand the actual status of its update support and pay attention to regional policy differences.",
    tags_en: ["Motorola", "Edge 70 Max", "Android Software Updates", "Software Support", "Device Lifecycle"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Google", url: "https://9to5google.com/2026/07/16/motorola-android-updates-confusing-inconsistencies", lang: "EN" }
    ]
