    title: "OnePlus 品牌軟體策略調整：OxygenOS 將逐步替換為 ColorOS，並從 Android 17 開始推送更新",
    summary: "由於業務策略調整，OnePlus 宣布其自有的 Android 系統介面 OxygenOS 將逐步淘汰。所有現役的 OnePlus 設備，包括在印度等全球地區的用戶，將從 Android 17 的更新版本開始，轉移至 Oppo 的 ColorOS 系統。OnePlus 表示，此舉旨在簡化軟體開發流程、加速更新交付，並利用共享的工程與研發資源，以持續為現有設備提供更新。雖然 OxygenOS 曾是 OnePlus 的核心品牌識別，但此整合有助於長期提供持續的軟體支援。對於符合升級範圍的用戶，將有選擇性更新至 ColorOS 的選項。對於不包含在 Android 17 更新範圍內的舊型號，仍會繼續接收版本維護支援。此外，用戶若升級至 ColorOS，仍可選擇回滾至 OxygenOS。此舉也影響了 Oppo 的姊妹品牌 Realme，該品牌也確認將從 Android 17 開始轉向 ColorOS。",
    tags: ["OnePlus", "ColorOS", "OxygenOS", "Android 17", "Oppo", "軟體更新", "品牌整合"],
    title_en: "OnePlus Adjusts Software Strategy: OxygenOS to Gradually Transition to ColorOS, Starting with Android 17 Updates",
    summary_en: "Due to business strategy adjustments, OnePlus announced the gradual phasing out of its proprietary Android system interface, OxygenOS. All active OnePlus devices, including users in global regions such as India, will transition to Oppo's ColorOS system starting with Android 17 updates. OnePlus stated that this move aims to simplify the software development process, accelerate update delivery, and leverage shared engineering and R&D resources to continue providing updates for existing devices. Although OxygenOS was once a core brand identifier for OnePlus, this integration helps ensure long-term, continuous software support. Users eligible for the upgrade will have the option to update to ColorOS. Older models not included in the Android 17 update scope will continue to receive version maintenance support. Furthermore, users who upgrade to ColorOS will still have the option to roll back to OxygenOS. This move also affects Oppo's sister brand, Realme, which has also confirmed that it will transition to ColorOS starting with Android 17.",
    tags_en: ["OnePlus", "ColorOS", "OxygenOS", "Android 17", "Oppo", "Software Update", "Brand Integration"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Google", url: "https://9to5google.com/2026/07/16/oneplus-software-updates-android-17-coloros", lang: "EN" }
    ]
