    title: "OnePlus 宣布退出美國與歐洲市場，用戶設備將從 OxygenOS 轉移至 ColorOS",
    summary: "OnePlus 官方宣布，將「終止」在北美和歐洲地區的新產品發布，實質上宣布退出這兩個市場。雖然公司在美國和歐洲的銷售通路將改變，但對於現有用戶而言，OnePlus 承諾軟體支援不會終止。未來設備將從 OxygenOS 轉移至 ColorOS，並將持續提供作業系統和安全更新，保固與維修服務也將維持不變。這代表用戶的下一代大版本軟體更新將標誌著 OxygenOS 的終結。值得注意的是，雖然公司強調印度市場仍是重要市場，但有可靠報導指出，OnePlus 可能也將在印度逐步縮減營運。對於用戶而言，雖然品牌和生態系統發生重大變動，但短期內使用現有產品仍可維持正常運作。",
    tags: ["OnePlus", "ColorOS", "OxygenOS", "市場策略", "軟體支援", "品牌變更"],
    title_en: "OnePlus Announces Exit from US and European Markets; User Devices to Transition from OxygenOS to ColorOS",
    summary_en: "OnePlus officially announced it will 'discontinue' new product releases in North America and Europe, effectively announcing its withdrawal from these two markets. Although the company's sales channels in the US and Europe will change, OnePlus assures existing users that software support will not cease. Future devices will transition from OxygenOS to ColorOS, and the company will continue to provide operating system and security updates, while warranty and repair services remain unchanged. This signifies that the next major version software update for users will mark the end of OxygenOS. Notably, while the company emphasizes that the Indian market remains important, reliable reports suggest that OnePlus may also gradually scale back its operations in India. For users, although there are significant changes in brand and ecosystem, current products can continue to function normally in the short term.",
