    category: "重點關注",
    title: "LM Studio發布Bionic：新一代AI代理應用，擴展本地與雲端開源模型能力",
    summary: "LM Studio宣布推出Bionic，這是一款專為Mac和Windows設計的AI代理應用程式。Bionic旨在利用開源模型，協助使用者處理編碼、研究和複雜文件工作。它提供本地模型運行環境，同時也透過LM Studio Secure Cloud提供存取大型開源模型，適用於更複雜的推理、工具呼叫和長上下文任務。所有雲端請求均遵循「零數據保留」政策，確保隱私。在功能上，Bionic具備跨應用程式的語音鍵盤，並預裝了Mistral AI的Voxtral模型進行本地語音轉錄。對於開發者，它支援建立Code專案，讓開源模型（如GLM 5.2和Kimi K2.7 Code）直接分析、編輯或除錯程式碼庫，並提供內聯差異比較和代理程式碼搜尋。此外，在Work專案中，Bionic可在沙盒環境處理文件（如PDF、簡報、試算表），進行資料整理、摘要和編輯，並支援自動檢查點回溯，大幅提升知識工作流程的安全性與效率。",
    tags: ["LM Studio", "Bionic", "AI Agent", "開源模型", "Mac", "Windows", "本地部署"],
    title_en: "LM Studio Releases Bionic: A Next-Generation AI Agent Application Expanding Local and Cloud Open-Source Model Capabilities",
    summary_en: "LM Studio announced the launch of Bionic, an AI agent application designed for Mac and Windows. Bionic aims to utilize open-source models to assist users with coding, research, and complex document work. It provides a local model running environment while also offering access to large open-source models via LM Studio Secure Cloud, suitable for more complex inference, tool calling, and long-context tasks. All cloud requests adhere to a \"zero data retention\" policy, ensuring privacy. Functionally, Bionic includes a cross-application voice keyboard and comes pre-loaded with Mistral AI's Voxtral model for local voice transcription. For developers, it supports building Code projects, allowing open-source models (such as GLM 5.2 and Kimi K2.7 Code) to directly analyze, edit, or debug codebases, and providing inline diff comparison and agent code search. Furthermore, in Work projects, Bionic can process documents (such as PDFs, presentations, and spreadsheets) in a sandbox environment, performing data organization, summarization, and editing, and supporting automatic checkpoint rollback, significantly enhancing the security and efficiency of knowledge work workflows.",
