    title: "微軟將 Comic Chat 開源：重現 1990 年代 IRC 聊天歷史軟體",
    summary: "微軟宣布將其早年開發的 Comic Chat 聊天客戶端開源，該軟體最初於 1996 年與 Internet Explorer 3.0 一同推出，提供帶有漫畫風格頭像的 IRC 聊天功能。Comic Chat 曾是微軟早期產品線的一部分，後來更名為 Microsoft Chat 2.0，但已停用超過二十年。此次開源的目的是為了保存這段重要的軟體歷史，並讓社群能夠進行探索、學習和開發。微軟提供了原始的 C++ 和 MFC 程式碼快照，並附帶了幾組利用 AI 技術進行現代化改造的範例。這些範例展示了如何讓這款 1990 年代的程式碼在現代的 Visual Studio 工具和高解析度 Windows 系統上運行，並連接到現代 IRC 伺服器。該專案已在 GitHub 上以 MIT 授權公開，鼓勵社群進行實驗和創新。",
    tags: ["Microsoft", "Comic Chat", "IRC", "開源", "歷史軟體", "MIT 授權"],
    title_en: "Microsoft Open-Sources Comic Chat: Reviving 1990s IRC Chat History Software",
    summary_en: "Microsoft announced the open-sourcing of Comic Chat, a chat client developed in its early days. The software was originally launched in 1996 alongside Internet Explorer 3.0, offering IRC chat functionality with comic-style avatars. Comic Chat was once part of Microsoft's early product line, later renamed Microsoft Chat 2.0, but has been discontinued for over two decades. The goal of this open-sourcing is to preserve this important piece of software history and allow the community to explore, learn, and develop. Microsoft provided original C++ and MFC code snapshots, along with several examples utilizing AI technology for modernization. These examples demonstrate how the 1990s code can run on modern Visual Studio tools and high-resolution Windows systems, and connect to modern IRC servers. The project has been released on GitHub under the MIT license, encouraging community experimentation and innovation.",
    tags_en: ["Microsoft", "Comic Chat", "IRC", "Open Source", "Historical Software", "MIT License"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/Microsoft-Comic-Chat-OSS", lang: "EN" }
    ]
